  "bio": "Dom is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Matthews, United States, specializing in illustrative tattoos that encapsulate the essence of horror, gaming, and pop culture. Renowned for their clean and precise lines, Dom brings each client's vision to life with an impressive level of detail and artistry. Clients seeking to immortalize their love for niche genres in ink will find Dom's portfolio and dedication to cleanliness at @mimiktattoo an inspiring starting point for their next tattoo journey.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Matthews, North Carolina, United States\n\nNeo Traditional Tattoo Artist\nCharlotte, NC. @seventhsintattoo\n⬇️ BOOKING & MERCH HERE ⬇️",
